<title>POLAND: Polish bourse clears for listing Mostostal Krakow.</title>
<headline>Polish bourse clears for listing Mostostal Krakow.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of the Warsaw Stock Exchange cleared for main market listing shares in construction firm Mostostal Krakow SA and new issues of Mostostal Warszawa and Bytom, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>Stomil Sanok rubber firm informed earlier on Wednesday that it also won the bourse approval for main market trading.</p>
<p>The bourse also agreed to transfer Indykpol SA poultry producer to the main market from the bourse's parallel floor and admitted ING Barings Securities (Poland) SA securities as its member.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
